        {
          "text": "**The Sönke Ahrens \"Smart Notes\" Method:** A deep dive into the specific workflow that popularized the Zettelkasten method for academic and non-fiction writing, focusing on its principles of active processing and idea generation.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 75,
          "source": "topic-set_pkm-strategies-for-cognitive-enhancement_🆔20251023215537.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Cognitive Load Theory in PKM:** A more technical look at *why* atomic noting works, exploring how it reduces cognitive load by externalizing memory, freeing up mental resources for higher-order thinking.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 76,
          "source": "topic-set_pkm-strategies-for-cognitive-enhancement_🆔20251023215537.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The \"CODE\" Framework (Collect, Organize, Distill, Express):** An exploration of this popular PKM workflow, focusing specifically on the \"Distill\" phase as the core of analytical work and sense-making.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 76,
          "source": "topic-set_pkm-strategies-for-cognitive-enhancement_🆔20251023215537.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Epistemology and PKM:** A philosophical inquiry into how the *structure* of your knowledge base (e.g., hierarchy vs. network) reflects and shapes your personal epistemology, or *how you know what you know*.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 79,
          "source": "topic-set_pkm-strategies-for-cognitive-enhancement_🆔20251023215537.md"
        }
      ]
